#
# The files this repository keeps BYTE-IDENTICAL with java-llama.cpp, BitcoinAddressFinder,
# srcmorph and streambuffer (each lists the ones it carries). Checked by the `shared-files` job of
# .github/workflows/publish.yml (.github/check-shared-files.py, see .github/buildcheck/sharedfiles.py):
# a copy changed here alone fails it, a copy another repository lists with a different hash warns.
# To change a shared file: change it in every repository listing it, then run
# `python3 .github/check-shared-files.py --write` in each. An entry `<workflow>#<job>` stands for one
# job of a workflow (kept identical inside otherwise different workflows); `sha256sum -c` reads the
# file entries only.
